@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1

### Get all cats
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats

### Add new cat with a image
POST {{baseUrl}}/cats
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RestClientBoundary

--RestClientBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

tbonesteak
--RestClientBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2024-11-11
--RestClientBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

3.5
--RestClientBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="owner"

3603
--RestClientBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat"; filename="crab.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:\Users\Admin\express\public\crab.png
--RestClientBoundary--

### Get all cats after adding
GET {{baseUrl}}/cats
